# gdx project-level semgrepignore.
#
# Presence of this file overrides semgrep's bundled default. We re-list the
# standard exclusions we DO want, and intentionally omit the default's `_*`
# pattern so underscore-prefixed directories are still scanned.
#
# 2026-08-23: the two directories this originally named —
# `tests/_adversarial/` and `tests/_reproductions/` — were deleted (no runner
# existed for the first; the second's files were named `bug_test_*.py`, which
# pytest cannot collect, with their assertions commented out). The `_*`
# omission is KEPT anyway: it is the right default for a repo that puts real
# code behind underscore-prefixed paths, and re-adding it would silently drop
# any future one from the scan.

# Source control
.git/
.svn/
.hg/

# Python build/cache
.venv/
.tox/
.eggs/
*.egg-info/
__pycache__/
.mypy_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
build/
dist/

# Node
node_modules/

# Editors / OS
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store

# Repo-specific archives we don't scan
_archive_historical/
_archived_feedback_2026-04-18/
